'''The Thrillerz''' (スリラーズ ''Surirāzu'', '''Thrillerz''') are a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Those Guys]] found in [[Into the Future]]'s [[Zombie Outbreaks]], [[Uncanny Legends]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. They were added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]].

